d an API key later to keep the reviews updated.":["Du kannst diesen Schritt auch \u00fcberspringen, aber dann musst du sp\u00e4ter einen API-Schl\u00fcssel hinzuf\u00fcgen, damit die Bewertungen aktualisiert werden."],"You have reached the maximum sources limit, Please enter a valid API key to retrieve new sources.":["Du hast die maximale Anzahl an Quellen erreicht. Bitte gib einen g\u00fcltigen API-Schl\u00fcssel ein, um neue Quellen abzurufen."],"Are you using a local host? API keys may be required for all review retrieving.":["Verwendest du einen lokalen Host? M\u00f6glicherweise sind f\u00fcr das Abrufen aller Bewertungen API-Schl\u00fcssel erforderlich."],"Select Source Type":["Quellenart ausw\u00e4hlen"],"Add Downloads":[""],"Add Source Details":["Quellen-Details hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"Your URL must contain \"\/themes\/\" or \"\/plugins\/\". Examples: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/plugins\/instagram-feed\/<\/a>, <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/themes\/twentytwentythree\/<\/a>":["Deine URL muss \u201e\/themes\/\u201c oder \u201e\/plugins\/\u201c enthalten. Beispiele: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/plugins\/instagram-feed\/<\/a>, <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/themes\/twentytwentythree\/<\/a>"],"Enter an Airbnb listing URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.airbnb.com\/rooms\/12345678<\/a>":[""],"Enter a Booking.com hotel URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.booking.com\/hotel\/us\/hotel-name.html<\/a>":[""],"Enter an AliExpress product URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.aliexpress.com\/item\/1234567890123.html<\/a>":[""],"Enter the Trustpilot review page URL, not just the domain. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.trustpilot.com\/review\/www.example.com<\/a>":[""],"Enter a listing URL or ID first.":[""],"That does not look like a valid listing URL or ID. Check it and try again.":[""],"Could not add source. Please check the listing URL or location ID and your API key, then try