t (wird beim Bezahlen automatisch angewendet)"],"And much more!":["Und vieles mehr!"],"Hide Features":["Funktionen ausblenden"],"Show Features":["Funktionen anzeigen"],"Made with":["Gebaut mit"],"Items":["Elemente"],"Bulk Actions":["Mehrfachaktionen"],"Delete":["L\u00f6schen"],"You are going to delete the selected feeds.":[""],"You will lose all feed settings.":[""],"Are you sure you want to continue?":[""],"This feed is not currently used on any pages.":[""],"place":["Standort"],"places":["Standorte"],"This feed is used in":[""],"If you delete this feed, these pages will no longer display reviews.":[""],"Delete \"":["L\u00f6schen"],"Delete Feeds?":["Feeds l\u00f6schen?"],"Feed Deleted":["Feed Gel\u00f6scht"],"Shortcode":["Shortcode"],"Instances":["Instanzen"],"Actions":["Aktionen"],"Copy Shortcode":["Shortcode kopieren"],"Used in ":["Verwendet in "],"Duplicate":["Duplizieren"],"Feed Duplicated":["Feed dupliziert"],"Create your feed":["Erstelle deinen Feed"],"Connect your Google, Facebook, Yelp or Tripadvisor account and choose a feed type":["Verbinde dein Google-, Facebook-, Yelp- oder Tripadvisor-Konto und w\u00e4hle einen Feed-Typ"],"Customize your feed type":["Passe deinen Feed-Typ individuell an"],"Choose layouts, color schemes, filters and more":["W\u00e4hle Layouts, Farbschemata, Filter und mehr"],"Embed your feed":["Deinen Feed einbetten"],"Easily add the feed anywhere on your website":["F\u00fcge den Feed ganz einfach \u00fcberall auf deiner Website ein"],"Edit Products":[""],"Enter a name for this source":[""],"Saving...":[""],"Network error. Please check your connection and try again.":[""],"Add Source":["Quelle hinzuf\u00fcgen"],"Loading, please wait":[""],"Review Feed Pro by Smash Balloon":["Reviews Feed Pro von Smash Balloon"],"Activate your plugin to get started":["Aktiviere dein Plugin, um loszulegen"],"Paste license key here":["F\u00fcge hier den Lizenzschl\u00fcssel ein"],"License Activated!":["Lizenz aktiviert!"],"Invalid License!":["Ung\u00fcltige Lizenz!"],"Don\u2019t have a license key?":["Du hast keinen Lizenzschl\u00fcssel?"],"Buy a License":["Eine Lizenz kaufen"],"After activating your plugin, you can...":["Nachdem du dein Plugin aktiviert hast, kannst du\u00a0\u2026"],"Collect New Reviews":["Neue Bewertungen sammeln"],"New reviews and data related to the reviews for your business are collected from external sites. Your license key can be used to access this data using Smash Balloon's API site.":["Neue Bewertungen und Daten zu den Bewertungen deines Unternehmens werden von externen Websites gesammelt. Mit deinem Lizenzschl\u00fcssel kannst du \u00fcber die API-Seite von Smash Balloon auf diese Daten zugreifen."],"With constant changes to WordPress and the APIs that your reviews are retrieved from, your plugin needs to stay up to date. Activating your license allows automatic updates from the Plugins page.":["Durch die st\u00e4ndigen \u00c4nderungen an WordPress und den APIs, \u00fcber die deine Bewertungen abgerufen werden, muss dein Plugin immer auf dem neuesten Stand sein. Wenn du deine Lizenz aktivierst, werden automatische Updates auf der Plugin-Seite durchgef\u00fchrt."],"Receive Technical Support":["Technische Unterst\u00fctzung erhalten"],"Although we pride ourselves on creating reliable, easy-to-use products our expert support team is here to help with any questions. Activating your license key is recommended to receive efficient support.":["Wir sind stolz darauf, zuverl\u00e4ssige und benutzerfreundliche Produkte zu entwickeln. Unser fachkundiges Support-Team steht dir bei allen Fragen zur Seite. Wir empfehlen dir, deinen Lizenzschl\u00fcssel zu aktivieren, um effizienten Support zu erhalten."],"Amazing Support Team.":["Fantastisches Support-Team."],"Having trouble using the plugin?":["Hast du Probleme bei der Plugin-Nutzung?"],"Contact our friendly support team.":["Kontaktiere unser freundliches Support-Team."],"Go to Support Form":["Zum Support-Formular"],"Create a feed":["Einen Feed erstellen"],"Dashboard":["Dashboard"],"Create a Review feed":["Einen Bewertungs-Feed erstellen"],"more":[""],"Confirm":["Best\u00e4tigen"],"You are using the new Google Places API":[""],"New API":[""],"License Key ":["Lizenzschl\u00fcssel "],"Your ":["Deine "]," License is ":[" Lizenz ist "],"Active":["Aktiv"],"Inactive":["Inaktiv"],"Expired":["Abgelaufen"],"Manage License":["Lizenz verwalten"],"Test Connection":["Verbindung testen"],"Connection Error":["Verbindungsfehler"],"Upgrade":["Upgrade durchf\u00fchren"],"Deactivate":["Deaktivieren"],"This source is not used by any feeds.":[""],"Are you sure you want to delete it?":[""],"feed":[""],"This source is used by":[""],"Delete ":["L\u00f6schen "],"Source Deleted!":["Quelle Gel\u00f6scht!"],"Select feed to export":[""],"Export":["Exportieren"],"Original Text":["Originaltext"],"Custom text\/translation":["Benutzerdefinierter Text\/\u00dcbersetzung"],"Context":["Kontext"],"New Reviews collected daily.":["Neue Bewertungen werden t\u00e4glich gesammelt."],"Clearing caches will trigger a full resync of all reviews. This may take a few minutes and could temporarily slow down your site.":[""],"Clear All Caches":["Alle Caches l\u00f6schen"],"You are using the Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider ":["Du verwendest die Lite-Version des Plugins\u00a0\u2013 du brauchst keine Lizenz. Viel Spa\u00df! \ud83d\ude42 Um mehr Funktionen freizuschalten, solltest du "],"Upgrading to Pro":["Ein Upgrade auf Pro durchzuf\u00fchren"],"As a valued user of our Lite plugin, you receive 50% OFF - automatically applied at checkout!":["Als gesch\u00e4tzter Benutzer unseres Lite-Plugins erh\u00e4ltst du einen Rabatt von 50\u00a0%, der automatisch beim Bezahlen verrechnet wird!"],"Install Pro":["Pro installieren"],"Select collection to export":[""],"Collection JSON exported!":[""],"Save Changes":["\u00c4nderungen speichern"],"Plugin Installed":["Plugin installiert"],"Unknown Error":["Unbekannter Fehler"],"Plugin Activated":["Plugin Aktiviert"],"Plugin Deactivated":["Plugin Deaktiviert"],"About Us":["\u00dcber uns"],"SmashBalloon Team":["Team von Smash Balloon"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Wir von Smash Balloon erstellen Software, mit der du in wenigen Minuten attraktive responsive Social-Media-Feeds f\u00fcr deine Website erstellen kannst."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["Unser Ziel ist, das Hinzuf\u00fcgen von Social-Media-Feeds in WordPress zu vereinfachen. Keine komplizierten Einrichtungsschritte, keine h\u00e4sslichen iFrame-Widgets und keine schlechten Werte bei der Seitengeschwindigkeit mehr."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Unsere Plugins sind nicht nur einfach zu bedienen, sondern auch komplett anpassbar, zuverl\u00e4ssig und schnell! Deshalb haben sich mehr als 1,6 Millionen Benutzer wie du daf\u00fcr entschieden, sie auf ihrer Website zu verwenden."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Unsere anderen Social-Media-Feed-Plugins"],"We're more than just a Reviews plugin! Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":["Wir sind mehr als nur ein Bewertungs-Plugin! Schau dir unsere anderen Plugins an und f\u00fcge auf deiner Website mehr Inhalte hinzu."],"Install":["Installieren"],"Installed":["Installiert"],"Social Wall":["Social-Pinnwand"],"Combine feeds from all of our plugins into a single wall":["Kombiniere Feeds aus all unseren Plugins in einem einzigen Feed"],"Plugins we recommend":["Von uns empfohlene Plugins"],"What are they used for?":[""],"Solving an issue in your plugin might sometime require testing API access but with your setup. We do not want to expose your API keys over support messages and hence we use a temporary login link system to securely access it.":[""],"What can a support executive access?":[""],"A support team member can only access Smash Balloon plugin to make API requests. They can NOT access any other plugins, create posts or in any way modify your WordPress website.":[""],"Can I disable or delete the temporary login link?":[""],"The login link is auto-destroyed in 14 days. You can also manually delete it any time you want.":[""],"Temporary Login Links":[""],"Dismiss":["Verwerfen"],"Search Documentation":["Dokumentation durchsuchen"],"Need more support? We're here to help.":["Brauchst du mehr Unterst\u00fctzung? Wir sind f\u00fcr dich da."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Ein Support-Ticket einreichen"],"Get Help in the WordPress.org Forum":["Hol dir Hilfe im Forum auf WordPress.org"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Unser schnelles und freundliches Support-Team hilft dir immer gerne weiter!"],"System Info":["Systeminformation"],"Collapse":["Einklappen"],"Expand":["Ausklappen"],"Export Settings":["Exporteinstellungen"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Gib deine Plugin-Einstellungen einfach f\u00fcr den Support frei"],"Temporary Login":[""],"Our team might require temporary login access with limited access to only our plugin to help you test your issues":[""],"Create Temporary Login Link":[""],"Temporary User Created":[""],"Temporary Login link for support access created by you. This is auto-destructed 14 days after creation. To create a new link, please delete the old one.":[""],"Link":["Link"],"Temporary User Deleted":[""],"Please enter you business name as it is in Google":[""],"Business name to search for Place ID":[""],"Business ID found":[""],"Clear Log":[""],"Code":[""],"Details":[""],"Moderate review feeds":["Bewertungs- Feeds moderieren"],"Display images and videos":["Bilder und Videos anzeigen"],"Upsell Modal Icon":["Symbol f\u00fcr Upsell-Modal"],"And get much more!":["Und erhalte noch viel mehr!"],"Add reviews to your collection":[""],"Organize reviews into collections, embed collections on any page":[""],"Collections help you organize your reviews in collections such as \u201cHomepage reviews\u201d or \u201cProduct reviews\u201d. You can then use them as a reviews source in any feed.":[""],"Add your first review to this collection":[""],"Add reviews from Google, Facebook, TrustPilot or Yelp. Collections help you hand-pick reviews and embed them on pages.":[""],"Create handpicked reviews collections to make the best first impression.":[""],"Or get them from your audience":[""],"You can also connect a form from WPForms or Formidable forms.":[""],"Add these collections as source on any feed. These work just like any other sources.":[""],"Name your Collection":[""],"Eg. Homepage Reviews":[""],"What are collections?":[""],"By duplicating this collection, all the reviews created and added to this collection will be duplicated too!":[""],"By deleting this collection, all the reviews created and added for it will be deleted too":[""],"Empty Collections Icon":[""],"Create collections of handpicked reviews to showcase them on your website, reviews page or product page":[""],"Okay, got it":[""],"Refresh List":[""],"No reviews found!":[""],"Add the review by manually typing it out":[""],"Or Add from existing source":[""],"Add the review from an existing source you have already connected":[""],"Select Reviewer Avatar Image":[""],"Use this media":[""],"Add Image to Review":[""],"You are about to edit this review":[""],"This review is displayed in":[""],"feeds. Editing it will change it on both those places. This action is irreversible.":[""],"User Avatar":[""],"Add Reviewer Image":[""],"Remove reviewer image":[""],"Rate %d star":[""],"Rate %d stars":[""],"First Name":[""],"John":[""],"Dow":[""],"The review title goes here":[""],"The content title goes here":[""],"Link to the review (Opt